DESCRIPTION >
    Versioned private Economics application configuration. The authenticated
    Worker reads the latest JSON payload; private forecast facts and reviewed
    reconciliation explanations must never be committed to the public client.

TOKEN "operations_ingest" APPEND
TOKEN "operations_ingest" READ

SCHEMA >
    `config` String `json:$.config`,
    `recorded_at` DateTime64(3) `json:$.recorded_at`

ENGINE MergeTree
ENGINE_SORTING_KEY recorded_at
